{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1069", "sample_idx": 42, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Subject: Invitation to Meeting on Upcoming Project\n\nDear Team\n\nI am writing to inform you that we will be having a meeting on the upcoming project that we are all working on. The meeting will be held on Friday at 2 PM in the conference room on the second floor of our building. I expect all of you to be there as we will be discussing some very important aspects of the project that are correlated with its overall success.\n\nAs you are all aware we have been experiencing some challenges with the project so far and it is imperative that we come together to discuss these issues and find solutions. The meeting will provide a platform for us to share our experiences and insights and to work together to overcome the obstacles that we are facing.\n\nThe agenda for the meeting will include a review of the project's current status and a discussion of the challenges that we are experiencing. We will also be discussing the plans that are in place to move the project forward and the resources that we will need to complete it successfully. I have asked our project manager to prepare a detailed report on the project's progress and to present it to us during the meeting.\n\nI would like to encourage all of you to come prepared to the meeting by reviewing the project's current status and by thinking about the challenges that we are facing and the potential solutions. We will be having a brainstorming session during the meeting where we will be sharing our ideas and suggestions on how to move the project forward.\n\nThe meeting will be a crucial step in ensuring the success of our project and I expect all of you to be actively engaged and participating in the discussions. We will be covering a lot of ground during the meeting and I am confident that by the end of it we will have a clear understanding of the project's requirements and the steps that we 